WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.817 --> 00:00:14.919
Crown, the owner of Downtown Diamonds, turned onto West Street.

2
00:00:14.939 --> 00:00:18.260
"It's a lovely morning," he said.

3
00:00:19.161 --> 00:00:20.622
Squish! Mr.

4
00:00:20.662 --> 00:00:22.703
Crown's foot sank into something soft.

5
00:00:23.303 --> 00:00:23.943
He looked down.

6
00:00:24.424 --> 00:00:25.724
Garbage was everywhere.

7
00:00:26.465 --> 00:00:28.526
A rotten banana was stuck to the bottom of his shoe.

8
00:00:28.546 --> 00:00:31.287
"This street is filthy!"

9
00:00:31.688 --> 00:00:32.148
he cried.

10
00:00:34.016 --> 00:00:35.878
When he arrived at his store, he stopped.

11
00:00:36.578 --> 00:00:37.819
The windows were smashed.

12
00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:40.421
He looked in and gasped.

13
00:00:40.741 --> 00:00:44.184
"My diamonds are gone!"

14
00:00:44.204 --> 00:00:48.247
"Burp!" "Eww, Jack!"

15
00:00:48.648 --> 00:00:49.268
Mara said.

16
00:00:49.288 --> 00:00:50.890
"That's gross!"

17
00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:52.211
Jack shrugged.

18
00:00:52.231 --> 00:00:55.753
"Sorry!" Roxy and her friends were at lunch.

19
00:00:56.534 --> 00:00:58.255
Jack had just finished his iced tea.

20
00:00:59.256 --> 00:01:00.777
"Does anyone want my apple?"

21
00:01:01.138 --> 00:01:01.818
Terrell asked.

22
00:01:02.599 --> 00:01:03.680
Mara held up an orange.

23
00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:05.201
"I'll trade you."

24
00:01:05.982 --> 00:01:08.063
Roxy ate the last few bites of her taco.

25
00:01:08.083 --> 00:01:11.346
"These tacos are so good," she said.

26
00:01:12.167 --> 00:01:14.009
Terrell looked at his pizza crust and sighed.

27
00:01:14.029 --> 00:01:17.632
"I should have gotten tacos.

28
00:01:18.032 --> 00:01:19.894
This pizza tastes terrible."

29
00:01:22.236 --> 00:01:23.497
Jack stood up with his tray.

30
00:01:23.517 --> 00:01:24.698
"I'm done.

31
00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:25.779
Let's go out to recess."

32
00:01:26.980 --> 00:01:29.382
They went to throw out their trash and return their lunch trays.

33
00:01:30.042 --> 00:01:31.704
Terrell saw a large trash can.

34
00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:34.782
Trashman's Trash Pickup was stamped on the side.

35
00:01:34.802 --> 00:01:39.565
"What happened to the other trash company, Smart Brothers' Garbage Pickup?"

36
00:01:39.765 --> 00:01:40.446
Mara asked.

37
00:01:41.386 --> 00:01:42.307
Roxy looked around.

38
00:01:42.327 --> 00:01:45.629
"And what happened to the recycling and compost bins?"

39
00:01:45.649 --> 00:01:47.851
"Who cares?"

40
00:01:48.551 --> 00:01:52.254
Jack dumped his trash, iced tea bottle, and food scraps into the trash can.

41
00:01:52.274 --> 00:01:54.415
"Dumping trash is so easy now.

42
00:01:54.736 --> 00:01:56.157
We don't have to separate everything!"

43
00:01:57.037 --> 00:01:57.778
Mara frowned.

44
00:01:57.798 --> 00:02:00.720
"A lot of things can be recycled, Jack.

45
00:02:01.184 --> 00:02:03.085
And food can be composted."

46
00:02:04.025 --> 00:02:04.765
Terrell nodded.

47
00:02:04.785 --> 00:02:06.485
"That's right.

48
00:02:07.046 --> 00:02:10.286
And if we don't sort everything, it goes to a landfill.

49
00:02:10.707 --> 00:02:12.527
Then the garbage just sits there.

50
00:02:13.307 --> 00:02:14.988
It's not good for the environment."

51
00:02:15.628 --> 00:02:16.388
Jack sighed.

52
00:02:16.408 --> 00:02:17.809
"I guess you're right."

53
00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:27.871
As Terrell, Mara, and Roxy threw away their trash, Roxy smiled.

54
00:02:27.891 --> 00:02:30.492
"I know how to get rid of all the trash!"

55
00:02:31.644 --> 00:02:33.025
"How?" Terrell asked.

56
00:02:33.785 --> 00:02:34.565
Roxy laughed.

57
00:02:35.766 --> 00:02:37.707
"Rocket Girl can use her heat vision.

58
00:02:37.967 --> 00:02:39.367
She can burn it all up!"

59
00:02:40.328 --> 00:02:41.168
Terrell smiled.

60
00:02:41.848 --> 00:02:43.509
"That's ridiculous, Roxy.

61
00:02:44.169 --> 00:02:47.391
Rocket Girl has more important things to do than burn trash."

62
00:02:48.931 --> 00:02:49.632
Jack laughed.

63
00:02:50.512 --> 00:02:51.292
"Terrell's right!"

64
00:02:53.053 --> 00:02:54.554
Just then Roxy's watch beeped.

65
00:02:56.755 --> 00:02:59.056
Roxy stepped into the hallway and turned on her watch.

66
00:03:03.528 --> 00:03:04.988
Mayor Bloom appeared on the screen.

67
00:03:05.749 --> 00:03:09.310
Behind him, Roxy saw a wastepaper basket overflowing with trash.

68
00:03:09.330 --> 00:03:12.551
"Mayor Bloom," Roxy said.

69
00:03:12.571 --> 00:03:13.911
"What's wrong?"

70
00:03:13.931 --> 00:03:17.212
"We need your help, Rocket Girl," the mayor said.

71
00:03:17.232 --> 00:03:20.173
"Metro City Electronics has just been robbed!"

72
00:03:20.193 --> 00:03:23.354
"Don't worry, Mayor," Roxy said.

73
00:03:23.374 --> 00:03:25.415
"I'm on my way!"
